   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Repaints your picture in the style of another picture (IP-Adapter \"style transfer\": colours, brushwork, medium, not the content).\nInput image = the picture to repaint. Style picture = the look to copy (a painting, an illustration, a texture...).\nStyle weight 1.0 (up to 1.5 for a stronger look). Denoise 0.75: lower keeps more of the original.\nThe layout is kept with the picture's line art (Lineart preprocessor, shown as the Line art preview). Prompt: what is in the picture (optional).\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
